  "html": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"premium-nav site-header\" role=\"banner\">\n  <div class=\"premium-container premium-nav-inner container\">\n    <a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup\" href=\"/\">\n      <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span>\n      <span><b>Wishly</b><small>Create moments</small></span>\n    </a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" id=\"wishly-guide-navigation\" class=\"premium-nav-links nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"/guides/\">Guides</a>\n      <a href=\"/features/\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"/guides/create-wish-website/\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"/about/\">About</a>\n      <a href=\"/faq/\">FAQ</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-mobile-link\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open main website ↗</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-mobile-link nav-mobile-primary\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create website →</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"premium-nav-actions nav-actions\">\n      <a class=\"wp-trigger main-site-pill\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Main Wishly — open Wishly main website\">\n        <span class=\"wp-av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"wp-label\">Main Wishly</span><span class=\"wp-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create website <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n      <a class=\"lang-link\" href=\"/bn/\" lang=\"bn\">বাংলা</a>\n      <button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-controls=\"wishly-guide-navigation\" class=\"menu-toggle mobile-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">GET IN TOUCH</span><h1>Questions, feedback<br/><em>or a correction?</em></h1><p>Contact the Wishly team about guide corrections, product questions, editorial feedback or website-related enquiries.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"container policy-layout\"><article class=\"article\"><p class=\"policy-updated\">Last updated: 7 November 2026</p><h2>Contact the Wishly team</h2><p>For questions about Wishly Guide, product features, templates or an article correction, visit the <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">official Wishly contact page</a>. This keeps enquiries in the same support channel used by the main Wishly website.</p><h2>What to include in a correction</h2><p>Please include the article URL, the sentence or instruction that needs attention and—when possible—a short explanation of the correct information. Do not send passwords, payment details or other sensitive information.</p><h2>Publisher and project</h2><p>Wishly Guide is an information website associated with Wishly, created by RA Fahim. Visit <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wishly</a> for the main website or <a href=\"https://rafahim.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">RA Fahim’s website</a> for founder information.</p></article></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n      <div class=\"premium-container\">\n        <div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n          <div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n              <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n            </a>\n            <p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n            <